- plugin: Deactivate, replace or update Plugin A — Switching off Plugin A 1.0.0 would stop: whatever it provides (no feature in the table maps to it; read its description: none). Of the two plugins that declare the same name, deactivate the one whose features you need least, or ask its author to prefix the name.
- plugin: Deactivate, replace or update Plugin B — Switching off Plugin B 1.0.0 would stop: whatever it provides (no feature in the table maps to it; read its description: none). Of the two plugins that declare the same name, deactivate the one whose features you need least, or ask its author to prefix the name.
